      "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2608.21884v3",
      "observed": "Section 2.2 summarizes this repository's seven patterns, readiness levels L0-L3, failure-mode catalogs and tooling (Greyling 2026b, accessed 2026-07-15). Section 3 lists a snapshot of the repository and the essay among reviewed sources, notes the sources are not independent and build on Osmani's posts, and finds no systematic evidence of benefit. Section 4.1 says the detection heuristics and thresholds were drafted from this repository. Mining: 217 of 36,487 analyzed repositories had autonomous agent loops; no confirmed committed state file; verifiers and budgets found only through session annotation. The cost row says observed run logs hold template values, not measurements, citing this repository.",
